# The pre-#4966 shape: a refused start returns a handle to an operation that never existed.
MODULE: HandleHasRecordRejectedHandle
TARGET: HandleHasRecord
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a start refused at admission still hands the caller a handle
PERTURBS: StartRejected

--- FIND
    /\ rejects' = rejects + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alive, crashes, stalls, handles, launches>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ rejects' = rejects + 1 /\ handles' = handles \cup {o}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alive, crashes, stalls, launches>>
--- END
